stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE : Initial
    IDLE --> HOMING : StartGluing AND DeviceReady AND NOT TankEmpty
    IDLE --> IDLE : NOT StartCondition

    HOMING --> APPROACH : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oHomeRef
    HOMING --> FAULT : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oError

    APPROACH --> GLUE_START : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oDone
    APPROACH --> FAULT : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oError

    GLUE_START --> GLUE_CONTINUE : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oDone
    GLUE_START --> FAULT : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oError

    GLUE_CONTINUE --> CLEAN : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oDone
    GLUE_CONTINUE --> FAULT : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oError

    CLEAN --> IDLE : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oDone
    CLEAN --> FAULT : V90Servo[SERVO_Z].oError

    FAULT --> HOMING : Reset AND RecoveryCount < 3
    FAULT --> FAULT : NOT Reset OR RecoveryCount >= 3

    note right of IDLE : Ready state, waiting for start
    note right of HOMING : Homing Z-axis servo
    note right of APPROACH : Move to approach position
    note right of GLUE_START : Start glue dispensing at slow speed
    note right of GLUE_CONTINUE : Continue to end position
    note right of CLEAN : Move to clean position
    note right of FAULT : Error state with retry logic